"Modified version with gaming optimizations for extra performance. Reliable "
"for most users but may rarely cause instabilities."
msgstr ""
"Modifisert versjon med optimaliseringer for spilling for ekstra ytelse. "
"Pålitelig for de fleste brukere, men kan sjelden forårsake ustabilitet."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:298
msgid "Development"
msgstr "Utvikling"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:300
msgid ""
"Built from the very latest source code with cutting-edge features. Offers "
"the best gaming performance but is the least tested — only for advanced "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Bygget fra den aller nyeste kildekoden med banebrytende funksjoner. Gir best"
" spillytelse, men er minst testet — kun for avanserte brukere."

